<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-006> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#description> "Owner's voice note on the first properly cold night: using saved chicken bones for broth and dried herbs from Week 1, introduces new supplier Rosa (reached via Dave), notes Dave's daughter requested dumplings, and reflects on story-driven posts working better across the last two weeks." .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-006> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#emotionalTone> "warm, quietly reflective" .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-006> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#entryId> "entry-006" .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-006> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#entryType> "candidate-fact" .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-006> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#memoryVersionUsed> "business-memory-v2" .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-006> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#sourceReference> "Alright, it's gotten properly cold now. I saved the bones from last week's chicken, didn't want to waste them, so I've had broth going most of the day. Still had some of that basil from week one too, the dried stuff, going into the filling tonight along with some fresh vegetables. Also — I've got a new supplier now, Rosa. She runs a small farm stand a few blocks over. Dave mentioned us to her, and she reached out, had some end-of-season vegetables and herbs she wanted to find a good home for. Worked out well for both of us. Dave's daughter actually asked for dumplings specifically, apparently, so that's what tonight is. Looking back at the last couple weeks, the posts that actually did something were the ones with a real story behind them, not just a plain menu listing. So, keeping that up. Three weeks in now, and it feels like everything's just building on the last thing, which is nice. Hoping people keep coming back for this kind of thing, not just trying it once." .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-006> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#sourceType> "voice-note-transcript" .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-006> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#status> "confirmed" .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-006> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#title> "Owner voice note — first frost, new supplier, dumplings" .
