<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-007> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#description> "Started sourcing root vegetables and herbs from Rosa Alvarez's local farm stand, a few blocks over. Reached via Dave's word-of-mouth referral. Mutually beneficial: Rosa had end-of-season produce she wanted a good home for, The Neighborhood Table got fresher, better-priced ingredients than the grocery store." .
