<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-008> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#description> "Dumplings in broth made from saved Week 2 chicken bones, filled with vegetables and herbs from the new Rosa's Farm Stand partnership, seasoned with dried basil saved from Week 1. Requested by Dave's daughter. First week where nothing was newly bought from scratch — every ingredient traces back to a previous week's memory or the new supplier relationship." .
