<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-008> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#explainability> "Generated using Business Memory Asset v3 and Journey Ledger entries entry-006 (voice note) and entry-007 (partnership). Dish (dumplings) directly requested by Dave's daughter, per entry-006. Ingredients trace back to entry-004's chicken bones (broth) and entry-001's dried basil (filling seasoning), plus new produce from keyPerson Rosa via the entry-007 partnership. successfulPattern (updated in v3: story-driven posts confirmed across Weeks 1-2) and nextContentStrategy (updated in v3: highlight local relationships) directly shaped this entry's story-first framing, rather than the generic tone-based reasoning used in Week 1. Caption checked against avoidPhrases — none used." .
